      "1": {
        "text": "Set unique items ki collection hoti hai. Ye items ko order mein nahi rakhta, aur duplicates allow nahi karta. Set curly brackets se banta hai, bilkul dictionary ki tarah, lekin bina keys aur values ke. Set tab kaam aata hai jab tumhe sirf ye pata ho ki kaunse items present hain, unka order ya position nahi."
      },
      "3": {
        "text": "Items add aur remove karna"
      },
      "4": {
        "text": "Ek item dalne ke liye add use karo, aur kisi item ko remove karne ke liye discard use karo jo ho bhi sakta hai aur nahi bhi. remove method bhi item delete karta hai, lekin agar item missing hai to error deta hai, isliye jab sure nahi ho to discard safe hai. Item set mein hai ya nahi, ye check karne ke liye in word bhi use kar sakte ho."
      },
      "6": {
        "text": "Set operations"
      },
      "7": {
        "text": "Sets ke beech useful operations hote hain. Union do sets ko ek set mein jodta hai jisme dono ke saare items hote hain. Intersection sirf wohi items rakhta hai jo dono sets mein aate hain. Difference pehle set ke woh items rakhta hai jo doosre set mein nahi hain."
      },
      "9": {
        "text": "Jab Python set print karta hai, to items ka order har run mein change ho sakta hai. Jab predictable result chahiye ho to items ko fixed order mein dikhane ke liye sorted use karo."
      }
